HHIISSTTOORRYY
       ppaammsslliiccee replaced ppggmmsslliiccee in Netpbm 10.3 (June 2002).  It was backward
       compatible,  but  worked  on  Netpbm  images other than PGM and PBM and
       added the --ppllaannee and --xxmmggrr options.


